  "display_fullname": "Mastermind Summon Demon Summoning Deadly Lahar",
  "display_help": "With knowledge of a forbidden ritual, you open a gate to an infernal dimension, allowing a torrent of fire and mud to pour through to our world. The Deadly Lahar will deal tremendous fire damage to a single target when cast. The mudslide will sprawl into a sixty foot radius patch which ignites nearby opponents and the original target. All enemies will be slowed and have a chance to be held.",
